      "compression_ratio": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0001",
      "start": 7.22,
      "end": 8.22,
      "text": "missions.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.209,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0002",
      "start": 8.22,
      "end": 14.34,
      "text": "SCT Inst means that the money arrives on the beneficiary's account in less than 10 seconds,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.209,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0003",
      "start": 14.34,
      "end": 18.34,
      "text": "24 hours a day, every day of the year.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.209,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0004",
      "start": 18.34,
      "end": 25.94,
      "text": "Messages follow the ISO 20022 standard, the payment itself is a PACS, 008 message,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.209,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0005",
      "start": 25.94,
      "end": 30.06,
      "text": "and the answer is a PACS, 002 status report.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.209,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.115,
      "compression_ratio": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0006",
      "start": 30.06,
      "end": 33.3,
      "text": "The hardest part in real projects is timeouts.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082,
      "compression_ratio": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0007",
      "start": 33.3,
      "end": 38.82,
      "text": "On the Bank HexA mission, we started with a 5 second timeout towards the clearing, and",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082,
      "compression_ratio": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0008",
      "start": 38.82,
      "end": 44.98,
      "text": "moved to 7 seconds after measuring real response times, so don't copy a number.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082,
      "compression_ratio": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0009",
      "start": 44.98,
      "end": 45.98,
      "text": "Measure it.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082,
      "compression_ratio": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0010",
      "start": 45.98,
      "end": 51.1,
      "text": "Second trap, retries, a retry must never create a second payment.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082,
      "compression_ratio": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0011",
      "start": 51.1,
      "end": 54.46,
      "text": "Use the UETR as an idempotency key.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.207,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.082,
      "compression_ratio": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "practice-03-sepa-instant-intro#0012",
      "start": 54.46,
      "end": 61.5,
      "text": "And last, since October 2025, the instant payments regulation requires a verification",
      "avg_logprob": -0.234,
